","start":153,"end":156,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p049","text":"十年，孝公卒，孝公弟潘因衛公子開方殺孝公子而立潘，是為昭公。昭公，桓公子也，其母曰葛嬴。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001134","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001134","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"潘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001135","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0012","start":12,"end":17,"surface":"衛公子開方","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001122","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"孝公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"潘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001135","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001135","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001135","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m049-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"葛嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001129","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p054","text":"至齊，齊桓公厚禮，而以宗女妻之，有馬二十乘，重耳安之。重耳至齊二歳而桓公卒，會豎刀等爲内亂，齊孝公之立，諸侯兵數至。留齊凡五歳。重耳愛齊女，毋去心。趙衰、咎犯乃於桑下謀行。齊女侍者在桑上聞之，以告其主。其主乃殺侍者，勸重耳趣行。重耳曰：「人生安樂，孰知其他！必死於此，不能去。」齊女曰：「子一國公子，窮而來此，數士者以子爲命。子不疾反國，報勞臣，而懷女德，竊爲子羞之。且不求，何時得功？」乃與趙衰等謀，醉重耳，載以行。行遠而覺，重耳大怒，引戈欲殺咎犯。咎犯曰：「殺臣成子，偃之願也。」重耳曰：「事不成，我食舅氏之肉。」咎犯曰：「事不成，犯肉腥臊，何足食！」乃止，遂行。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"宗女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"豎刀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001123","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"齊孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001134","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"齊女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001748","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000329","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m054-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"咎犯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001740","status":"contextual_provisional"},{